  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tAoE2 Dataset \u2014 SAGE\n\t\n\nThis repository contains two Age of Empires II: Definitive Edition match datasets, built as part of the SAGE research project. The data is rich but not polished for general consumption: it was designed around a specific set of research questions, and using it for anything else will require some work on your end. That said, the raw material is genuinely useful, time-series snapshots of real competitive games at minute and second resolution, with entity\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/Siewart/sage.",
